<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:70.9pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:
-70.9pt'><b style='mso-bidi-font-weight:normal'><span style='font-size:10.0pt'>2202.99</span></b><span
style='font-size:10.0pt'><span style='mso-tab-count:1'>               </span>6.
