text-autospace:none'><span style='font-size:10.0pt'>- terpenil, kısmen
hidrojene (CAS RN 61788-32-7) (% 74-87),<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:70.5pt;text-align:justify;mso-layout-grid-align:
none;text-autospace:none'><span style='font-size:10.0pt'>- polifeniller, dörtlü
ve daha fazla, kısmen hidrojene (CAS RN 68956-74-1) (% 10-18),<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:70.5pt;mso-layout-grid-align:none;
text-autospace:none'><span style='font-size:10.0pt'>- terpenil, (CAS RN
26140-60-3) (% 3 - 8).<o:p></o:p></span></p>

