.4pt'><span style='font-size:10.0pt'>Özellikler:<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:70.5pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:
.4pt'><span style='font-size:10.0pt'>- boyutlar (G × Y × D): 48 x 118 x 48 cm;<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:70.5pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:
.4pt'><span style='font-size:10.0pt'>- ağırlık: 50 kg;<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:70.5pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:
.4pt'><span style='font-size:10.0pt'>- tepsi başına yükleme kapasitesi: 10 kg;<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:70.5pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:
.4pt'><span style='font-size:10.0pt'>- hız: 0,8 m/s (maks. 1,5 m/s).<o:p></o:p></span></p>

