10.0pt'><span style='mso-list:Ignore'>-<span style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>                 
</span></span></span><![endif]><span style='font-size:10.0pt'>Gösterge modu:
normalde siyah;<o:p></o:p></span></p>

