(PTC- positive temperature coefficient),<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:92.1pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:
14.1pt'><span style='font-size:10.0pt'>- Plastik iç kapak,<o:p></o:p></span></p>

