"Times New Roman",serif;mso-ansi-language:TR'>1 (85. Fasıl Not 4(b)) ve 6 No.lu
Genel Yorum Kuralları uygulanmaktadır</span></b><b style='mso-bidi-font-weight:
normal'><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Times New Roman",serif'> </span></b><b
style='mso-bidi-font-weight:normal'><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:
"Times New Roman",serif;mso-ansi-language:TR'><o:p></o:p></span></b></p>

