<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:70.5pt;text-indent:-70.5pt'><b><span
style='font-size:10.0pt'>8517.79<span style='mso-tab-count:1'>               </span>5.
</span></b><b style='mso-bidi-font-weight:normal'><span style='font-size:10.0pt'>Hücresel
ağlar için (mobil) telefonların içine monte edilmek üzere tasarlanmış</span></b><span
style='font-size:10.0pt'>, aşağıdaki bileşenleri içeren <b style='mso-bidi-font-weight:
normal'>aksam:<o:p></o:p></b></span></p>

<div style='mso-element:frame;mso-element-frame-hspace:7.05pt;mso-element-wrap:
around;mso-element-anchor-vertical:paragraph;mso-element-anchor-horizontal:
page;mso-element-left:66.2pt;mso-element-top:12.15pt;mso-height-rule:exactly'>

<table cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0 hspace=0 vspace=0 align=left>
 <tr>
  <td valign=top align=left style='padding-top:0cm;padding-right:7.05pt;
  padding-bottom:0cm;padding-left:7.05pt'>
  <p class=ListeParagraf3CxSpFirst style='margin-left:106.8pt;mso-add-space:
  auto;text-align:justify;text-indent:-36.0pt;mso-list:l27 level1 lfo18;
