  mso-element-left:66.2pt;mso-element-top:12.15pt;mso-height-rule:exactly'><![if !supportLists]><span
  style='font-size:10.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman";mso-fareast-language:
  TR'><span style='mso-list:Ignore'>(i)<span style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>              
  </span></span></span><![endif]><span style='font-size:10.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:
  "Times New Roman";mso-fareast-language:TR'>Bobin ve mıknatıslardan oluşan,
  elektrik geldiğinde mekanik titreşim sağlayan lineer titreşim motoru;
  "sessiz" modda kullanılır;<o:p></o:p></span></p>
  <p class=ListeParagraf3CxSpMiddle style='margin-left:106.8pt;mso-add-space:
  auto;text-align:justify;text-indent:-36.0pt;mso-list:l27 level1 lfo18;
  mso-element:frame;mso-element-frame-hspace:7.05pt;mso-element-wrap:around;
  mso-element-anchor-vertical:paragraph;mso-element-anchor-horizontal:page;
  mso-element-left:66.2pt;mso-element-top:12.15pt;mso-height-rule:exactly'><![if !supportLists]><span
  style='font-size:10.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman";mso-fareast-language:
  TR'><span style='mso-list:Ignore'>(ii)<span style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>            
  </span></span></span><![endif]><span style='font-size:10.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:
  "Times New Roman";mso-fareast-language:TR'>12,1 mm x 7,1 mm x 3,5 mm
  ebadında, bir telefon konuşması sırasında karşıdan elektrik sinyali olarak
  aldığı sesleri ses sinyaline dönüştürerek veren (veya zil sesi, müzik gibi
  diğer bir hoparlörden verilen ses ve sinyalleri), efektif frekans bandı: 300
  Hz~ 3,4 kHz olan hoparlör (veya alıcı);<o:p></o:p></span></p>
  <p class=ListeParagraf3CxSpMiddle style='margin-left:106.8pt;mso-add-space:
  auto;text-align:justify;text-indent:-36.0pt;mso-list:l27 level1 lfo18;
  mso-element:frame;mso-element-frame-hspace:7.05pt;mso-element-wrap:around;
  mso-element-anchor-vertical:paragraph;mso-element-anchor-horizontal:page;
  mso-element-left:66.2pt;mso-element-top:12.15pt;mso-height-rule:exactly'><![if !supportLists]><span
  style='font-size:10.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman";mso-fareast-language:
  TR'><span style='mso-list:Ignore'>(iii)<span style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>           
  </span></span></span><![endif]><span style='font-size:10.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:
  "Times New Roman";mso-fareast-language:TR'>Çevresel sesleri, örneğin video
  çekerken, telefon tarafından kullanılabilecek elektrik sinyallerine
  dönüştüren mikrofon (telefon konuşması için telefonun alt kısmında ayrı bir
  mikrofon bulunur);<o:p></o:p></span></p>
  <p class=ListeParagraf3CxSpMiddle style='margin-left:106.8pt;mso-add-space:
  auto;text-align:justify;text-indent:-36.0pt;mso-list:l27 level1 lfo18;
  mso-element:frame;mso-element-frame-hspace:7.05pt;mso-element-wrap:around;
  mso-element-anchor-vertical:paragraph;mso-element-anchor-horizontal:page;
  mso-element-left:66.2pt;mso-element-top:12.15pt;mso-height-rule:exactly'><![if !supportLists]><span
  style='font-size:10.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman";mso-fareast-language:
  TR'><span style='mso-list:Ignore'>(iv)<span style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>           
  </span></span></span><![endif]><span style='font-size:10.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:
  "Times New Roman";mso-fareast-language:TR'>Harici bir kulaklık (başa veya
  kulağa takılan tipte) bağlayabilmek için konektör;<o:p></o:p></span></p>
  <p class=ListeParagraf3CxSpMiddle style='margin-left:106.8pt;mso-add-space:
  auto;text-align:justify;text-indent:-36.0pt;mso-list:l27 level1 lfo18;
  mso-element:frame;mso-element-frame-hspace:7.05pt;mso-element-wrap:around;
  mso-element-anchor-vertical:paragraph;mso-element-anchor-horizontal:page;
  mso-element-left:66.2pt;mso-element-top:12.15pt;mso-height-rule:exactly'><![if !supportLists]><span
  style='font-size:10.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman";mso-fareast-language:
  TR'><span style='mso-list:Ignore'>(v)<span style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>            
  </span></span></span><![endif]><span style='font-size:10.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:
  "Times New Roman";mso-fareast-language:TR'>Telefonun ana kartı ile eşya
  arasındaki bağlantıyı sağlamaya yönelik konektör;<o:p></o:p></span></p>
  <p class=ListeParagraf3CxSpLast style='margin-left:106.8pt;mso-add-space:
  auto;text-align:justify;text-indent:-36.0pt;mso-list:l27 level1 lfo18;
  mso-element:frame;mso-element-frame-hspace:7.05pt;mso-element-wrap:around;
  mso-element-anchor-vertical:paragraph;mso-element-anchor-horizontal:page;
  mso-element-left:66.2pt;mso-element-top:12.15pt;mso-height-rule:exactly'><![if !supportLists]><span
  style='font-size:10.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman";mso-fareast-language:
  TR'><span style='mso-list:Ignore'>(vi)<span style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>           
  </span></span></span><![endif]><span style='font-size:10.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:
  "Times New Roman";mso-fareast-language:TR'>Aksamın bileşenlerini desteklemek
  ve elektrik bağlantısı sağlamak için esnek baskılı devre kartı (FPCB);<o:p></o:p></span></p>
  </td>
 </tr>
