style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>                 
</span></span></span><![endif]><span style='font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%'>Çift
kişilik yatağın bulunduğu yatak odası,<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle style='margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;
margin-bottom:10.0pt;margin-left:70.9pt;mso-add-space:auto;text-align:justify;
