mso-fareast-font-family:Calibri'><span style='mso-list:Ignore'>-<span
style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>                 
</span></span></span><![endif]><span style='font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%'>Duş,
lavabo ve tuvalet ve<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoListParagraphCxSpLast style='margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;
margin-bottom:10.0pt;margin-left:70.9pt;mso-add-space:auto;text-align:justify;
text-indent:0cm;line-height:115%;mso-list:l15 level1 lfo9'><![if !supportLists]><span
